{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-96", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - Anxiety", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<h2><b>1. 문제 설명</b></h2>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/5d379ab2c7da78c6ee114f26fd0384b18bd23b6fdcf6c1cfe0abb54847cc6861.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<hr/>\n<h4><b>제공 파일</b></h4>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/f5bc63aa5fcd48a2fdb00e309c13b39dd8d537501509daa0793e4ff84f524057.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<hr/>\n<h2><b>2. 파일 구조 식별</b></h2>\n<p>- 실제 컨테이너 형식부터 확인</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>file chall.dmg\nxxd chall.dmg | head -5\ntail -c 512 chall.dmg | xxd | head -3</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/281d13cfa984d85b728b89c60ac33032abc0fb475d1658ebdedd7e197829db76.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>판독 포인트</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DOS/MBR boot sector, partition 1 : ID=0xee -&gt;  protective MBR, 즉 GPT 디스크</li>\n<li>파일 끝에 EFI PART(백업 GPT 헤더)가 보임,  UDIF 압축 DMG의 koly 트레일러가 없으므로 dmg2img 변환이 <br/>필요 없는 raw 이미지</li>\n<li>총 204,800섹터 * 512B = 104,857,600B, 정확히 100 MB로 떨어짐</li>\n<li>protective MBR 뒤 실제 GPT 헤더는 LBA 1(오프셋 0x200)부터 시작</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>파티션 테이블 확인</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>mmls chall.dmg</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/d24214d9c6d2b1534336354ae1df6f07c51ec6b65b054539c5d4b593e30953d2.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- 파티션은 하나뿐이고 이름이 disk image -&gt; macOS가 DMG를 만들 때 붙이는 기본 파티션명</p>\n<p>-  시작 오프셋 = 40 * 512 = 20480</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>파일시스템 판별</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>fsstat -o 40 chall.dmg\n# APFS면 볼륨 시작 + 0x20 위치에 NXSB 매직\ndd if=chall.dmg bs=512 skip=40 count=4 2&gt;/dev/null | xxd | head -8</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7d4d5fba5962669994726ff8b1f84990ee1af53180f05b95199cd004af29faae.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- fsstat은 Cannot determine file system type을 뱉지만 덤프 오프셋 0x20에 NXSB(APFS 컨테이너 슈퍼블록 매직)가 선명함</p>\n<p>- 블록 크기 0x1000(4096), 총 0x63F6 블록 ≈ 100 MB로 앞선 계산과 일치</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2><b>3. 마운트 시도 - apfs-fuse 빌드 트러블슈팅</b></h2>\n<p>- APFS는 리눅스 커널이 지원하지 않아 apfs-fuse를 쓰는 것이 정석</p>\n<p>- apfs-fuse는 오프셋 옵션이 없으므로 파티션만 따로 잘라내야 함</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>dd if=chall.dmg of=part.img bs=512 skip=40 count=204720 status=progress</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/20af24153f60798f3be71fcdee42a2e11d603dc59cdbbfd8b3f1a21f0418738d.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>문제 1 - CMake 4.x 호환성</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>git clone https://github.com/sgan81/apfs-fuse.git\ncd apfs-fuse &amp;&amp; git submodule update --init\nmkdir build &amp;&amp; cd build &amp;&amp; cmake ..</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/0e99308ae489192d57e2d4a66ad52c87f520fe44ccac37e19b4baaf005b5ba32.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>CMake Error: Compatibility with CMake &lt; 3.5 has been removed</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- CMake 4.x부터 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5 미만) 지정을 거부</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>문제 2 - GCC 13+ 헤더 전이 include 제거</b></p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/8ace4b7eea7928a35f12e026da2bd016b6600e10181ea2ebc5212947463972ee.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- GCC 13부터 표준 헤더의 전이적 include가 사라져 &lt;cstdint&gt;를 명시하지 않은 구형 소스가 줄줄이 깨짐</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>sed -i '1i #include &lt;cstdint&gt;' ApfsLib/PList.h\n# 여러 파일에서 나면 한 번에\ngrep -rlE \"uint(8|16|32|64)_t\" ApfsLib/*.h ApfsLib/*.cpp | \\\nxargs -I{} sed -i '1i #include &lt;cstdint&gt;' {}</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>문제 3 -  7-Zip 다운로드 URL 404</b></p>\n<p>- 진짜 <b>개빡치</b>는 빌드 삽질을 접고 우회로를 택함..</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>sudo apt update &amp;&amp; sudo apt install -y 7zip\nsudo apt install 7zip-standalone # 7zz 바이너리는 이쪽\n7zz i | head -5</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/08f69eb9b6404df1ede9ef905abd937ae0b8d3592622c7ff2649a7766463dd36.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<hr/>\n<h2><b>4. APFS 볼륨 추출</b></h2>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>7zz l chall.dmg</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e8717128303e4700d6980d06111f99752ec56878eb36a6cc3cb38530f87143a1.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>7-Zip이 GPT를 파싱해 내부 APFS까지 자동 인식</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- Cannot open the file as [Dmg] archive 경고가 뜨지만 곧바로 [GPT] archive로 재해석해 내부 0.disk image.apfs(Offset 20480)를 열어줌 -&gt; 볼륨명이 Anxiety로 문제 제목과 일치</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/308d677952436304d08afab1b133c3edb6c9c9b47b6ed6bcdd4320200b5c5084.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>잘라낸 파티션으로도 동일</b></p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/a196b57bdc82b0e60c91f1374bfd7056e6a17bd13757a161ee15a29a0bb81df9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/ce55799708722717f848b4b668869ac629805796bb627c63531a93d6e2a74854.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>추출</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>mkdir -p /tmp/out\n7zz x chall.dmg -o/tmp/out -y</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/c6438aeb56862da2ab1017fb71c1c082d11d5b32d36ec71bd79b8c13ec1305e9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>추출 진행 - GPT -&gt; APFS 순으로 처리</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/4a98a8f9fe0082277b831427047fca23e5bea1d3a90ba6b05b9c28653412bcf9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<hr/>\n<h2><b>5. .zsh_history 분석</b></h2>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>cat /tmp/out/Documents/.zsh_history</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/4415c50b4a03be1c6049d057bbfa580883ed85308be9167422ce78de66f61e95.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>암호화 절차가 그대로 남아있음</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>cd /Documents\ncp ~/Downloads/asdfasdfsdf.jpg IMG_8492.JPG\nKEY=$(stat -f \"%FB\" IMG_8492.JPG | tr -d '.')\nopenssl enc -aes-256-cbc -salt -in flag.txt -out secret.enc -pass pass:$KEY -pbkdf2\nrm flag.txt</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>stat -f \"%FB\" 의 의미 </b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>stat -f는 BSD/macOS 계열의 포맷 지정 옵션</li>\n<li>%FB = file Birth time을 Float(초.나노초) 형태로 출력</li>\n<li>tr -d '.'로 소수점을 제거하면 19자리 숫자가 됨 -&gt; 패스워드</li>\n</ul>\n<p>-  APFS inode에 나노초 정밀도로 저장된 create_time을 복원하는 것이 이 문제의 전부</p>\n<p>-  birthtime은 ext4·NTFS에서는 흔히 유실되지만 APFS는 j_inode_val_t 구조체에 create_time을 나노초 단위로 보존</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>나노초 타임스탬프 획득</b></p>\n<p>- 일반 목록 출력은 초 단위에서 잘림 -&gt; -slt(show technical info) 옵션으로 전체 필드를 뽑음</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>7zz l -slt part.img | grep -A25 \"IMG_8492\"</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/9914799f5ebf0a63cda200ce9b5f43db0ff7ef7b40e13d4510bbd19a1598dbcc.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>Created = 2026-07-09 16:38:20.252210463 (iNode 20)</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<hr/>\n<h2><b>6. 복호화</b></h2>\n<p>- %FB는 Unix epoch 기준 값 -&gt; 표시된 시각을 epoch 초로 되돌려야 함</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>시도 1 -  UTC로 해석 -&gt; 실패</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>SEC=$(date -u -d \"2026-07-09 16:38:20\" +%s)\nKEY=\"${SEC}252210463\"\necho $KEY # 1783615100252210463</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/328c158132b29832cbf457cfb77d3f46e23aa3885ad71fcd424cd3975a60ada1.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>UTC 기준 epoch 계산</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>openssl enc -d -aes-256-cbc -in secret.enc -pass pass:$KEY -pbkdf2</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/24ea15290ef39323de5d06997105bf416d64f85161e4d5216657602703847434.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>bad decrypt - 패딩 검증 실패</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p>- bad decrypt는 키가 틀렸다는 뜻 -&gt; 타임스탬프를 로컬 타임존(KST)으로 변환해 표시했기 때문에 그대로 UTC로 해석하면 9시간이 어긋남</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>시도 2 - KST로 해석 -&gt; 성공</b></p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>SEC2=$(TZ=Asia/Seoul date -d \"2026-07-09 16:38:20\" +%s)\necho $SEC2 # 1783582700\ncd /tmp/out/Documents\nopenssl enc -d -aes-256-cbc -in secret.enc -pass pass:\"${SEC2}252210463\" -pbkdf2</code></pre>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/be7d7810f8116380b3aeb4c6215cf9448b848298d41a7d55fcf17f8b70e9d0c7.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>복호화 성공</figcaption>\n</figure><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/a96875da934fa7398bcacc570d8a579e90218b92e099290da23c1b7f622aa86f.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n</div>", "assets": ["08f69eb9b6404df1ede9ef905abd937ae0b8d3592622c7ff2649a7766463dd36.png", "0e99308ae489192d57e2d4a66ad52c87f520fe44ccac37e19b4baaf005b5ba32.png", "20af24153f60798f3be71fcdee42a2e11d603dc59cdbbfd8b3f1a21f0418738d.png", "24ea15290ef39323de5d06997105bf416d64f85161e4d5216657602703847434.png", "281d13cfa984d85b728b89c60ac33032abc0fb475d1658ebdedd7e197829db76.png", "308d677952436304d08afab1b133c3edb6c9c9b47b6ed6bcdd4320200b5c5084.png", "328c158132b29832cbf457cfb77d3f46e23aa3885ad71fcd424cd3975a60ada1.png", "4415c50b4a03be1c6049d057bbfa580883ed85308be9167422ce78de66f61e95.png", "4a98a8f9fe0082277b831427047fca23e5bea1d3a90ba6b05b9c28653412bcf9.png", "5d379ab2c7da78c6ee114f26fd0384b18bd23b6fdcf6c1cfe0abb54847cc6861.png", "7d4d5fba5962669994726ff8b1f84990ee1af53180f05b95199cd004af29faae.png", "8ace4b7eea7928a35f12e026da2bd016b6600e10181ea2ebc5212947463972ee.png", "9914799f5ebf0a63cda200ce9b5f43db0ff7ef7b40e13d4510bbd19a1598dbcc.png", "a196b57bdc82b0e60c91f1374bfd7056e6a17bd13757a161ee15a29a0bb81df9.png", "a96875da934fa7398bcacc570d8a579e90218b92e099290da23c1b7f622aa86f.jpg", "be7d7810f8116380b3aeb4c6215cf9448b848298d41a7d55fcf17f8b70e9d0c7.jpg", "c6438aeb56862da2ab1017fb71c1c082d11d5b32d36ec71bd79b8c13ec1305e9.png", "ce55799708722717f848b4b668869ac629805796bb627c63531a93d6e2a74854.png", "d24214d9c6d2b1534336354ae1df6f07c51ec6b65b054539c5d4b593e30953d2.png", "e8717128303e4700d6980d06111f99752ec56878eb36a6cc3cb38530f87143a1.png", "f5bc63aa5fcd48a2fdb00e309c13b39dd8d537501509daa0793e4ff84f524057.png"]}